<title>SWITZERLAND: Swissair in codeshare with Aeromexico.</title>
<headline>Swissair in codeshare with Aeromexico.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-07-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swissair said it had signed a codeshare agreement with Aerovias de Mexico (Aeromexico) and would start serving the Mexican capital from August 12.</p>
<p>Swissair, a unit of SAirGroup, said in a statement that a new daily connection would leave Zurich and reach Mexico City via Atlanta.</p>
<p>Another new daily connection will depart from Geneva and reach Mexico City via New York.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
